      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003106,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "SpeakerName": "讲师",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "题目是『孤独中的绝望与希望』。/n无言剧当然也是一人一个来演。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20031060070",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003106008,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003106,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "讲师",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "主题比较抽象，可能会有些难，/n但请把各位心中的故事，从开端一直演到结尾。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20031060080",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
